      "source": [
        "## Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "### Word Cloud & TF-IDF\n",
        "\n",
        "Before running any LLM extraction, I performed classical NLP exploration to understand the corpus structure and surface dominant themes. A word cloud (with domain-specific stopwords filtered) and TF-IDF analysis revealed the vocabulary landscape.\n",
        "\n",
        "![](/assets/projects/ai-patient-journey/wordcloud.png)\n",
        "\n",
        "TF-IDF scoring identifies terms that are *distinctive* across transcripts — not just frequent, but discriminative. The top terms confirm the treatment-heavy nature of these interviews and surface both medical terminology and patient experience language."
      ],
      "id": "42695476"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "tfidf = TfidfVectorizer(\n",
        "    max_features=1000, stop_words=\"english\",\n",
        "    ngram_range=(1, 2), min_df=2, max_df=0.85,\n",
        ")\n",
        "tfidf_matrix = tfidf.fit_transform(df[\"interview_transcript\"])\n",
        "feature_names = tfidf.get_feature_names_out()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"TF-IDF matrix shape: {tfidf_matrix.shape}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Vocabulary size: {len(feature_names)}\")"
