      "source": [
        "### Chain-of-thought Extraction\n",
        "\n",
        "The LLM is prompted to first *identify* relevant information by category, then *structure* it into the Pydantic schema. This two-step approach improves accuracy on complex temporal reasoning — treatment order and referral sequences in particular.\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column-margin}\n",
        "The pipeline uses `asyncio` with semaphore-based concurrency, rotating requests across multiple Gemini models to maximize free-tier throughput (~3× faster than sequential).\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "### Loading Extracted Records\n",
        "\n",
        "After extraction, records are validated through Pydantic and flattened into a DataFrame for analysis:"
